// That page confirms the qualification, the two-paper structure, and that the
// 2027–2029 syllabus revision changes the marks and duration of Paper 1 (up)
// and Paper 2 (down) while leaving the assessment METHODS unchanged. Because
// the numbers are in flux, this pack deliberately never states a mark total or
// a paper duration — it teaches the skill each paper rewards instead. Check
// mark allocations against your own syllabus copy for your exam series.
//
