// evaluative final part) — no past-paper wording is reproduced.
//
// 0455 is a DIAGRAM subject, and this pack is text. Every diagram is therefore
// taught verbally and precisely: which variable is on which axis, which curve
// moves, which direction it moves, and what the new intersection proves. The
// `cheat` array carries five full diagram walkthroughs (demand & supply, the
// four shift cases, elasticity shapes, externalities, and the PPC). Draw them
// on paper as you read — the words are a script for your pencil, not a
// substitute for it.
//
// All elasticity figures in the worked answers are invented but internally
// consistent; every percentage and division below was checked by hand.

